! acc1  (Arista EOS)
!
! Access layer — L2 only, no IP routing.
! Uplink to dist1 (trunk), client-a on access port VLAN 10.
!
hostname acc1
!
spanning-tree mode rstp
!
vlan 10,20,30,99
!
interface Ethernet1
   description to-dist1  trunk
   switchport trunk allowed vlan 10,20,30,99
   switchport mode trunk
   no shutdown
!
interface Ethernet2
   description to-client-a  access-vlan10
   switchport access vlan 10
   switchport mode access
   no shutdown
!
! ================================================
! acc1  —  Capstone Tasks
!
! Role: Access switch — L2 only, no routing
!
! Task 1 — STP PortFast on client-facing port
!   Enable portfast on Ethernet2 so the client port skips the STP
!   listening/learning states and comes up immediately.
!   Hint (under interface Ethernet2):
!     spanning-tree portfast
! ================================================
!
end
